              <mx:String>A solution of (R)-8-chloro-4-methyl-2-phenyl-2,3,4,5-tetrahydropyrido[3,2-f][1,4]oxazepine (5.00 mg, 0.02 mmol) and 4-(3-methyl-1H-1,2,4-triazol-1-yl)aniline (3.17 mg, 0.02 mmol) in DME (.5 mL) was added via a syringe to a capped microwave vial containing PALLADIUM(II) ACETATE (0.409 mg, 1.82 µmol), XANTPHOS (1.053 mg, 1.82 µmol) and CESIUM CARBONATE (8.89 mg, 0.03 mmol) under an argon atmosphere.</mx:String>
